        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-09, 3 Inch Center to Center Contemporary Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA quick way to update your kitchen is to change out your cabinet hardware--and what better way to make the space more modern than to use cabinet door pulls that reflect the clean lines and sleek shapes of contemporary design. RK International's Contemporary Curve Cabinet Pull has a very now look. It manages to give the impression of movement through it's design and that is important to give the space flow. Available in 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-09 Contemporary Curves Cabinet Door Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
